<figure>
	<div class="image-wrapper"><img alt="Bastille Day fireworks lit up the sky around the tower before the blaze ignited on the nearby Pont d&#039;I&eacute;na bridge." title="2YEEYK7PZXWJPUAH4SEVYX26KA" fetchpriority="high" src="https://www.nydailynews.com/wp-content/uploads/migration/2016/07/14/2YEEYK7PZXWJPUAH4SEVYX26KA.jpg" class=" size-article_feature" sizes="(max-width: 40em) 620px,(min-width: 40em) and (max-width: 50em) 780px,(min-width: 50em) and (max-width: 65em) 1020px,(min-width: 65em) and (max-width: 80em) 1280px,(min-width: 80em) 1860px,1860px" srcset="https://www.nydailynews.com/wp-content/uploads/migration/2016/07/14/2YEEYK7PZXWJPUAH4SEVYX26KA.jpg?w=535 620w,https://www.nydailynews.com/wp-content/uploads/migration/2016/07/14/2YEEYK7PZXWJPUAH4SEVYX26KA.jpg?w=673 780w,https://www.nydailynews.com/wp-content/uploads/migration/2016/07/14/2YEEYK7PZXWJPUAH4SEVYX26KA.jpg?w=879 1020w,https://www.nydailynews.com/wp-content/uploads/migration/2016/07/14/2YEEYK7PZXWJPUAH4SEVYX26KA.jpg?w=1101 1280w,https://www.nydailynews.com/wp-content/uploads/migration/2016/07/14/2YEEYK7PZXWJPUAH4SEVYX26KA.jpg?w=1200 1860w" ></div>			<figcaption>
							<div class="photo-credit">GEOFFROY VAN DER HASSELT/AFP/Getty Images</div>
						Bastille Day fireworks lit up the sky around the tower before the blaze ignited on the nearby Pont d&#8217;I&eacute;na bridge.		</figcaption>
	</figure>
<div class="meta"><img alt='Author' src='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/?s=85&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g' srcset='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/?s=170&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-85 photo avatar-default coauthor-avatar' height='85' width='85' /><div class="coauthor-avatar-container"><div class="byline">By <a href="https://www.nydailynews.com/author/tobias-salinger/" title="Posts by Tobias Salinger" class=" author-name" aria-label="Author: Tobias Salinger" rel="author">Tobias Salinger</a></div><div class="time">PUBLISHED: <time datetime="2016-07-14 14:51:51">July 14, 2016 at 6:51 PM EDT</time> | UPDATED: <time datetime="2018-04-08 16:57:42">April 8, 2018 at 8:57 PM EDT</time></div></div></div></div><div class="article-body"><div class="body-copy"><p>A truck carrying fireworks caught fire next to the Eiffel Tower in Paris just as an attack killed <a href="http://www.nydailynews.com/news/world/truck-crashes-crowd-bastille-day-celebration-france-article-1.2712028" target="_blank">as many as 73 Bastille Day revelers</a> in the French Riviera capital of Nice.</p>
<p>The blaze in Paris ignited at the Pont d&#8217;I&eacute;na bridge over the River Seine due to a &#8220;technical incident,&#8221; the Paris Police Prefecture announced <a href="https://twitter.com/prefpolice/status/753708496382812160" target="_blank">on Twitter</a> Thursday night.</p>
<figure>
<div class="image-wrapper"><img loading="" class="lazyload size-article_feature" data-sizes="auto" alt="An image posted to social media shows clouds of black smoke surrounding the Eiffel Tower on Thursday night. Police said the accidental fire was put out quickly." title="An image posted to social media shows clouds of black smoke surrounding the Eiffel Tower on Thursday night. Police said the accidental fire was put out quickly." data-src="/wp-content/uploads/migration/2016/07/14/EPMGESJHREDJNHQ7TAT5ST6J4Q.jpg"></div><figcaption>An image posted to social media shows clouds of black smoke surrounding the Eiffel Tower on Thursday night. Police said the accidental fire was put out quickly.</figcaption></figure>
<p>Police officials asked residents to avoid the area but later rejected talk circulating online that the landmark had caught fire as part of an attack on both cities.</p>
<figure>
<div class="image-wrapper"><img loading="" class="lazyload size-article_feature" data-sizes="auto" alt="Police said in a statement on Twitter that the world-famous tower did not catch fire." title="Police said in a statement on Twitter that the world-famous tower did not catch fire." data-src="/wp-content/uploads/migration/2016/07/14/3U3HIMH3PYZIRQDGCGTMHQYMUA.jpg"></div><figcaption>Police said in a statement on Twitter that the world-famous tower did not catch fire.</figcaption></figure>
<p>&#8220;Don&#8217;t spread false rumors,&#8221; police officials said in <a href="https://twitter.com/prefpolice/status/753719036245073920" target="_blank">a statement</a>, according to a translation from French. &#8220;No fire to the #TourEiffel. An accidental truck fire took place at Pont d&#8217;I&eacute;na. It has been extinguished.&#8221;</p><div class="s2nPlayer k-papQS7n5" data-type="float" data-s2n-api="dfm_stn_player_script_id_papQS7n5"></div><script>	function dfm_stn_player_script_id_papQS7n5( getS2NApiForPlayer ) {
		if( typeof window.MNGAuthentication !== 'undefined' ){
			const s2nApi = getS2NApiForPlayer( document.querySelector('.k-papQS7n5') );
			s2nApi.float =  ! window.MNGAuthentication.isUserSubscriber();
		}
	}</script>

<p>A Video posted <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VLNvwf3vUrQ" target="_blank">on YouTube</a> showed clouds of black smoke from the blaze surrounding the world-famous tower. There were no reported injuries.</p>
<figure>
<div class="image-wrapper"><img loading="" class="lazyload size-article_feature" data-sizes="auto" alt="Bastille Day fireworks lit up the sky around the tower before the blaze ignited on the nearby Pont d'I&eacute;na bridge." title="Bastille Day fireworks lit up the sky around the tower before the blaze ignited on the nearby Pont d'I&eacute;na bridge." data-src="/wp-content/uploads/migration/2016/07/14/2YEEYK7PZXWJPUAH4SEVYX26KA.jpg"></div><figcaption>Bastille Day fireworks lit up the sky around the tower before the blaze ignited on the nearby Pont d&#8217;I&eacute;na bridge.</figcaption></figure>
</p>
